7.  Huang L., Yu W., Ma W., Zhong W., Feng Z., Wang H., Chen Q., Peng W., Feng X., Qin B., Liu T. A survey on hallucination in large language models: Principles, taxonomy, challenges, and open questions // ACM Transactions on Information Systems. 2025. Vol. 43 (2). P. 1-55. DOI: 10.1145/3703155. URL: https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.05232 
